<Placemark>
	<name>Jaure old airstrip 2026-11-15 07:42:58</name>
	<description><![CDATA[<!-- desc_gen:start -->
<font color="black"><table width="100%"><tr><td width="100%" align="center"><a href="files/1000062822.jpg" target="_blank"><img src="files/1000062822.jpg" width="60px" align="right" style="border: 3px white solid;"></a><br /><br /><a href="files/1000062820.jpg" target="_blank"><img src="files/1000062820.jpg" width="60px" align="right" style="border: 3px white solid;"></a><br /><br /><a href="files/1000062816.jpg" target="_blank"><img src="files/1000062816.jpg" width="60px" align="right" style="border: 3px white solid;"></a><br /><br />
<!-- desc_user:start -->
Jaure airstrip has been closed for quite a long time after 1993. According to one source who grew up at Jaure, there was a flight that came and circled above the airstrip after it was cleared but never landed. Even after that there were no other flights that landed. That same year, the same aircraft circled above Aiyari airstrip but never landed too.
<!-- desc_user:end -->
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1"><hr></td></tr><tr><td><table width="100%"><tr><td align="left" valign="center"><small><b>Altitude</b></small></td><td align="center" valign="center">803 m</td></tr>
