<Placemark>
	<name>Suari Primary School Building 2026-11-15 06:15:40</name>
	<description><![CDATA[<!-- desc_gen:start -->
<font color="black"><table width="100%"><tr><td width="100%" align="center"><a href="files/1000062811.jpg" target="_blank"><img src="files/1000062811.jpg" width="60px" align="right" style="border: 3px white solid;"></a><br /><br />
<!-- desc_user:start -->
Suari Primary School is located in Jaure and not in Suari. It was moved from Aiyari to Jaure in 2024. In 2025 the two school buildings in bush materials were erected and this year students attended classes.<br />The 2 in one building is partly in use. One half of the classroom is incomplete from the inside and not in use, while the other half of the building is completed and used by grade 5 students.
<!-- desc_user:end -->
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1"><hr></td></tr><tr><td><table width="100%"><tr><td align="left" valign="center"><small><b>Altitude</b></small></td><td align="center" valign="center">832 m</td></tr>
<tr><td align="left" valign="center"><small><b>Speed</b></small></td><td align="center" valign="center">1.9 km/h</td></tr>
